:"Poke at it daily and watch the progress."}},{"id":"apprentice_staff","shape":"staff","pal":"wood","rarity":"N","name":{"zh":"学徒法杖","en":"Apprentice Staff"},"desc":{"zh":"顶上的绿宝石来自第一封回复邮件。","en":"The green gem came from your first reply email."}},{"id":"iron_hammer","shape":"hammer","pal":"iron","rarity":"N","name":{"zh":"铁锤","en":"Iron Hammer"},"desc":{"zh":"把简历锤到一页纸。","en":"Hammers a resume down to one page."}},{"id":"coffee_stirrer","shape":"wand","pal":"coffee","rarity":"N","name":{"zh":"咖啡搅拌棒","en":"Coffee Stirrer"},"desc":{"zh":"早上九点前的唯一法器。","en":"The only magic before 9 a.m."}},{"id":"sticky_knife","shape":"dagger","pal":"paper","rarity":"N","name":{"zh":"便利贴飞刀","en":"Sticky-Note Knife"},"desc":{"zh":"贴满显示器，提醒你今天的任务。","en":"Covers your monitor with today's quests."}},{"id":"draft_quill","shape":"quill","pal":"wood","rarity":"N","name":{"zh":"草稿羽毛笔","en":"Draft Quill"},"desc":{"zh":"写了第 17 版求职信。","en":"Wrote the 17th draft of that cover letter."}},{"id":"iron_mace","shape":"mace","pal":"iron","rarity":"N","name":{"zh":"铁钉头锤","en":"Iron Mace"},"desc":{"zh":"敲开 ATS 系统的第一下。","en":"The first knock on the ATS gate."}},{"id":"steel_sword","shape":"sword","pal":"steel","rarity":"R","name":{"zh":"钢剑","en":"Steel Sword"},"desc":{"zh":"磨砺过的经历，锋利得多。","en":"Polished experience cuts much sharper."}},{"id":"referral_dagger","shape":"dagger","pal":"network","rarity":"R","name":{"zh":"内推匕首","en":"Referral Dagger"},"desc":{"zh":"从侧门直接刺进面试名单。","en":"Slips you through the side door to the shortlist."}},{"id":"elven_bow","shape":"bow","pal":"elven","rarity":"R","name":{"zh":"精灵长弓","en":"Elven Longbow"},"desc":{"zh":"百步之外命中 JD 关键词。","en":"Hits JD keywords from a hundred paces."}},{"id":"frost_spear","shape":"spear","pal":"frost","rarity":"R","name":{"zh":"霜冻长矛","en":"Frost Spear"},"desc":{"zh":"面对冷邮件，保持冷静。","en":"Stay cool through the cold emails."}},{"id":"bronze_axe","shape":"axe","pal":"bronze","rarity":"R","name":{"zh":"青铜战斧","en":"Bronze Battleaxe"},"desc":{"zh":"劈开「需要 5 年经验」